{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30117","headline":"寻陈处士山堂 · 刘得仁","name":"寻陈处士山堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步溪凡几转，始得见幽踪。\n路隐千根树，门开万仞峰。\n片云生石窦，浅水卧枯松。\n穷谷风光冷，深山翠碧浓。\n鹤看空里过，仙向坐中逢。\n底露秋潭水，声微暮观钟。\n他年来此定，异日愿相容。\n且喜今归去，人间事更慵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}